<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:33:01 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>全球最大的健康和美容零售商表示人工智能将使购物“更加人性化，而不是更少”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/as-watson-ceo-malina-ngai-ai-retail-jobs/</link><description>AS Watson 首席执行官 Malina Ngai 警告说，人工智能的最大风险是用它来完善当今的流程。这样做，“你就会得到昨天的版本”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55515068326_48249b9ac7_o-e1789207435987.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:46:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/as-watson-ceo-malina-ngai-ai-retail-jobs/</guid></item><item><title>Boards 是为垂直世界而构建的。风险已经水平化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/boards-were-built-for-a-vertical-world-risk-has-gone-horizontal/</link><description>治理可能会对其自身的设计产生压力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Jane-Sadowsky_Hero.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/boards-were-built-for-a-vertical-world-risk-has-gone-horizontal/</guid></item><item><title>“没有人来救我”：瑞茜·威瑟斯彭 (Reese Witherspoon) 如何从好莱坞无法解决的问题中打造一家价值 9 亿美元的公司</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/how-reese-witherspoon-built-900-million-hello-sunshine-problem-hollywood-wouldnt-fix/</link><description>在好莱坞告诉她没有女性主导的电影可拍后，这位女演员制作了《你好阳光》。六年后，她以 9 亿美元的价格将其出售。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GettyImages-2234576796-e1778869656241.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:31:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/how-reese-witherspoon-built-900-million-hello-sunshine-problem-hollywood-wouldnt-fix/</guid></item><item><title>杰米·戴蒙 (Jamie Dimon) 管理着摩根大通 (JPMorgan) 的 30 万名员工，但他表示，该公司通过在海豹突击队规模的团队中作战来击败竞争对手</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-small-teams-navy-seals-delta-force-social-loafing-ai-workplace-productivity-management-leadership/</link><description>数十年的研究支持这样的观点：随着团体规模的增加，个人的努力会减少。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2286277545-e1789134526603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:25:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/jamie-dimon-jpmorgan-small-teams-navy-seals-delta-force-social-loafing-ai-workplace-productivity-management-leadership/</guid></item><item><title>美国学校直到硅谷用谎言说服他们才被打破——现在阅读和数学成绩正在直线下降</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/american-schools-silicon-valley-lie-edtech-chromebook-ai-back-to-school/</link><description>神经科学家贾里德·库尼·霍瓦斯 (Jared Cooney Horvath) 警告称，美国在学校笔记本电脑上投入 300 亿美元，导致 Z 世代的认知能力不如他们的父辈。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-485807013-e1772231762277.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:19:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/american-schools-silicon-valley-lie-edtech-chromebook-ai-back-to-school/</guid></item><item><title>IBM 在今年的美国网球公开赛上推出了肢体追踪功能，它可以为每位网球运动员的发球得分，供球迷查看</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ibm-launched-limb-tracking-at-this-years-u-s-open-and-its-scoring-every-tennis-players-serve-for-fans-to-see/</link><description>这标志着 IBM 首次在大满贯网球锦标赛上推出肢体追踪功能。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293464141.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ibm-launched-limb-tracking-at-this-years-u-s-open-and-its-scoring-every-tennis-players-serve-for-fans-to-see/</guid></item><item><title>商会和大学理事会讨论美国高中缺失的科目：商业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/business-missing-american-high-schools-chamber-commerce-college-board/</link><description>学生们从高中毕业，却不清楚组织如何运作、资金如何流动以及想法如何变成机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2148292315-e1789006913832.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/business-missing-american-high-schools-chamber-commerce-college-board/</guid></item><item><title>幽灵卡特尔——你的定价算法可能在你不知情的情况下停止了竞争</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ghost-cartel-algorithms-antitrust-law/</link><description>反垄断法的制定是为了捕捉人类协议。它没有为机器学会自己做什么而命名。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1494177588-e1789006432241.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ghost-cartel-algorithms-antitrust-law/</guid></item><item><title>有缺陷的系统和一个人的傲慢让 Meta 股东损失了 170 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/zuckerberg-meta-17-billion-settlement-hubris-flawed-system/</link><description>Meta 的定居点看似庞大，但可能只是冰山一角。原告自己的模型显示损失达数万亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2268011935-e1789149679353.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/zuckerberg-meta-17-billion-settlement-hubris-flawed-system/</guid></item><item><title>从人工智能 FOMO 到人工智能宿醉：美国企业界现在正在认真审视镜子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ai-fomo-hangover-what-to-do-next-leadership/</link><description>公司如何错误地采用 GenAI，以及他们下一步需要做什么。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2191181043-e1789004968916.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/ai-fomo-hangover-what-to-do-next-leadership/</guid></item></channel></rss>